{
    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "text": "Are you all fine?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 12
        },
        {
            "text": "Fine? How the heck do you think we could be fine. Granpa... The Village... They're gone...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "That's not what I... Damn it, if only we'd been faster...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Yeah, if only the so called master had deemed useful to use his blade rather than show off and punch pluvials !",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I know, alright! I screwed up. I didn't think it would blow so soon...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "You knew? Then why didn't you warn us? We could have taken them with us.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I... I didn't want to cause a panic. I thought we had time to clear the mountains and then safely...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "It's all your damn fault. You're such a fraud.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Stop Zack... He tried to help us.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 1,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Maybe I can't say it's not my fault, but I know whose fault it is.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": 2
        },
        {
            "text": "What did you just say?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "The ones who opened the ruins and activated the self destruct function. I came here to stop them. That's why I sent you into the ruins instead of going there myself. I was looking for them.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Why? Why would they blow up the whole village. As if we care for some old ruins. We could have given them anything they wanted. Who would do this?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "They are called Caelum. Their goal is to use the war between Occidens and Archades to take control of both nations when they're at their lowest. ",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "What does that have to do with us?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "That crystal, the Xenolith. It holds more power than you think. But that power is now in our hands and it might be what we need to stop them.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Let me go with you.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "What?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "If they're the ones who did this... If it's really them, I want to make them pay.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I see... Then we will do this together. How about the rest of you?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Landfall Village was my home... I want to make them pay!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 2,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "I will come with you too.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 1,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "It's not like we have anywhere else to go.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 3,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Where are we going then?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 4,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        },
        {
            "text": "Occidens. Darius needs to be informed of what happened, and I need to cash in some favors. We'll be going through the Drenched Plains tomorrow. Get some rest.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 6,
            "ImageToShow": -1,
            "musictoplay": -1
        }
    ]
}